INSERT INTO feature VALUES('relative-monads','effects','Monads relative to the shift',NULL,'partial','uncommon','mainstream languages','A monad relative to `-F`, a unit and an extension over a family of computation types, declared as a theory with its laws as rules: each model proves them where it is sealed, completion orients them for fusion, and the extension''s continuation is a host thunk. The carrier is a theory''s sort into the computation types, `sort T(A : Type) : Type[-]`, which the option monad''s `-F Maybe(a)` models; the option monad''s operations and code polymorphic in the carrier check, and the left unit, the right unit and associativity join as one theory. A handler answers the extension: its return clause is the unit and its operation clauses the extension, and the theory''s laws are checked through its clauses; a return clause from a value to the carrier is owed.','theory-levitation surface-lowering kernel-term','corpus/model/desc/relative-monad.gandr corpus/pathological/desc/relative-monad.gandr crates/kernel-term/src/theory_rules/tests.rs::a_relative_monads_laws_join_their_overlaps_2328','corpus/ledger/features/relative-monads.gandr','#1951 #4383');
